# Flag 5 – Unobserved Execution Path Activation

## Invariant
All security-relevant execution paths must be observable and
verifiable.

## Telemetry
The binary emits functional logs but lacks execution-path telemetry
such as path hashing or runtime measurements.

## Observation
Observed. Execution paths can activate without being observed or
verified by monitoring systems.

## Security Impact
Unobserved execution paths enable persistent compromise while the
system appears healthy and correct.

## Limitations
This assessment focuses on telemetry absence rather than execution
path tracing.

